# Independent WEB-ONLY X Stash filter. GPL-3.0-only. See docs/X_AD_FILTER.md.
name: X 网页版去广告 · 预览
desc: 仅供 Safari/PWA 的 x.com 网页时间线与详情，过滤明确推广标记；仅解密 x.com，不包含 api.x.com 或 api.twitter.com。不能去除原生 App 广告，尚未本机验证；若影响加载请停用。
category: 去广告
version: 2026.10.24-web-preview.1
homepage: https://github.com/xian2023/stash-modules
http:
  mitm:
    - x.com
  script:
    - match: ^https://x\.com/i/api/graphql/[^/?#]+/(?:HomeTimeline|HomeLatestTimeline|TweetDetail)(?:\?|$)
      name: x-timeline-ads-866381593f3498d7
      type: response
      require-body: true
      binary-mode: false
      timeout: 2
      max-size: 2097152
script-providers:
  x-timeline-ads-866381593f3498d7:
    url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xian2023/stash-modules/main/scripts/x/866381593f3498d7/response.js
    interval: 86400
